                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:d7ad678b-0f30-45a2-b3c2-dd92c12c073e">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanTpEnableSynchronousTransmit</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">If this option is enabled, the CanTp will try to get a buffer and to transmit the FF or SF directly from the context of CanTp_Transmit.
                                    Otherwise, buffer request and transmission will be done during the next CanTp_MainFunction call.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanTpEnableSynchronousTransmit 配置项用于确定CAN传输层（CanTp）是否支持同步发送功能。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项为非标配置项，类型为Boolean，控制是否支持同步发送。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanTp_00305</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
