                      <SHORT-NAME>CanTpPaddingByte</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Used for the initialization of unused bytes with a certain value</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanTpPaddingByte 是用于定义在传输层（CAN Transport Layer）发送CAN帧时，填充剩余字节的值。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：类型为Int，用于填充的数据，ISO-15765-2默认配置为0xCC。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
